00:15:04,410 --> 00:15:07,540
And turns into a one-touch overhead kick for Misaki-kun.

264
00:15:07,620 --> 00:15:09,330
Come on, Misaki!

265
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:11,040
Score, Misaki!

266
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:15,000
Misaki-kun was the one who scored the equalizer just before the end of normal time.

267
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:17,710
So will he score the winning goal this time?

268
00:15:18,340 --> 00:15:20,340
I won't let him shoot.

269
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:24,090
Oh, Pierre-kun comes to block him.

270
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:25,010
Pierre!

271
00:15:25,090 --> 00:15:26,350
Pierre!

272
00:15:28,260 --> 00:15:29,390
Then...

273
00:15:30,270 --> 00:15:31,100
Catch!

274
00:15:31,310 --> 00:15:35,650
Misaki-kun, seeing Pierre-kun coming, passed.

275
00:15:35,730 --> 00:15:36,560
What!?

276
00:15:36,650 --> 00:15:38,480
Great pass, Misaki.

277
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:40,940
Hyuga-kun is there.

278
00:15:41,030 --> 00:15:43,450
He joined the attack late because of his injury.

279
00:15:43,530 --> 00:15:46,120
But as soon as he recovered, he ran all the way here.

280
00:15:46,450 --> 00:15:48,870
This is a three-man attack from Japan.

281
00:15:48,950 --> 00:15:53,370
This is a dream-like trio unity born in Europe.

282
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:55,580
Come on, Hyuga!

283
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:57,210
Catch, here it comes!

284
00:15:58,340 --> 00:16:00,960
Even if my leg shatters into a thousand pieces, it doesn't matter.

285
00:16:01,050 --> 00:16:05,720
I want to hammer this into France's goal!

286
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:09,970
Hyuga-kun receives Misaki's pass and fires a hard shot!

287
00:16:10,060 --> 00:16:11,970
The Tiger Shot is coming!

288
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:14,480
No!

289
00:16:16,190 --> 00:16:21,070
Pierre-kun reacts to the shot and goes to block it!

290
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:23,150
I won't let you score!

291
00:16:29,330 --> 00:16:30,870
He stopped it!

292
00:16:30,950 --> 00:16:34,870
Japan's three-man attack couldn't get past Pierre-kun!

293
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:39,380
Impossible!

294
00:16:40,380 --> 00:16:41,380
Damn it!

295
00:16:41,710 --> 00:16:43,510
Great, Pierre.

296
00:16:43,590 --> 00:16:44,880
Great block!

297
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:48,890
He can truly do everything, both defend and attack.

298
00:16:48,970 --> 00:16:53,310
A master in every area of the football game, he is France's captain.

299
00:16:53,390 --> 00:16:58,310
El Sid Pierre-kun, an incredible player.

300
00:16:58,810 --> 00:17:04,150
I told you, we will win this match.

301
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:06,400
Pierre.

302
00:17:07,110 --> 00:17:08,700
What a player, Pierre.

303
00:17:08,780 --> 00:17:09,660
Yes.

304
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:11,910
Oh, El.

305
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,290
Get moving.

306
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:17,790
And France attacks again.

307
00:17:18,170 --> 00:17:21,790
Hurry, this time we'll score!

308
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,300
Okay.

309
00:17:23,710 --> 00:17:25,300
They're coming.

310
00:17:25,470 --> 00:17:27,590
We're defending again.

311
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:30,300
Yes, we won't concede any goals.

312
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:33,060
France attacks fiercely again.

313
00:17:33,430 --> 00:17:35,770
Japan resists.

314
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,600
Misaki-kun.

315
00:17:37,690 --> 00:17:38,520
Okay.

316
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:43,440
Even Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun have joined the defense.

317
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:45,820
Belmondo.

318
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:49,110
Great, Tsubasa-kun.

319
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:52,530
France's fierce attacks continue.

320
00:17:55,580 --> 00:17:57,710
France constantly wins the ball.

321
00:17:58,210 --> 00:17:59,370
Hurry.

322
00:17:59,750 --> 00:18:01,250
Come on!

323
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:06,010
Great, Hyuga.

324
00:18:06,090 --> 00:18:07,090
Hyuga-kun.

325
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:10,050
Hyuga was the only one left on the attack line.

326
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:11,590
But now he's joined the defense.

327
00:18:11,890 --> 00:18:13,720
I won't let you pass.

328
00:18:14,470 --> 00:18:16,640
We don't lose!

329
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,770
The Japan team defends with all their being.

330
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:27,110
They fight to the end and defend Japan's goal.

331
00:18:27,490 --> 00:18:28,780
They are so stubborn.

332
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:30,610
What a team!

333
00:18:30,990 --> 00:18:32,240
Not over yet!

334
00:18:32,620 --> 00:18:34,490
France gets the ball again!

335
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:36,240
But there isn't much time!

336
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:38,910
Will this be the final attack?

337
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:44,500
He kicks it into the air.

338
00:18:45,590 --> 00:18:48,760
And the final whistle blows.

339
00:18:48,970 --> 00:18:53,760
And its high sound echoes through the sparkling Parisian sky.

340
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:55,510
Time is up.

341
00:18:56,140 --> 00:19:00,770
Both teams fought hard, but time is up.

342
00:19:00,890 --> 00:19:04,150
4-4, and this extra time also couldn't determine the winner.

343
00:19:04,230 --> 00:19:08,280
And the semifinal between Japan and France ends in a draw.

344
00:19:08,570 --> 00:19:12,280
Now we have penalty kicks to decide the finalist.

345
00:19:14,910 --> 00:19:17,620
We couldn't win in the end.

346
00:19:18,540 --> 00:19:19,910
It's over.

347
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:22,170
We defended.

348
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:27,800
Are you okay, guys?

349
00:19:28,050 --> 00:19:30,510
The Japan team's energy is exhausted.

350
00:19:30,590 --> 00:19:32,630
But they fought well.

351
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:37,810
They played with 10 men since the start of the match.

352
00:19:38,100 --> 00:19:42,440
This draw is also a kind of victory for them.

353
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:45,060
You guys were great.

354
00:19:49,730 --> 00:19:55,070
The spectators warmly applaud the two teams that fought so hard.

355
00:19:55,490 --> 00:19:57,580
They truly fought wonderfully.

356
00:19:57,740 --> 00:20:00,160
Both Japan and France.

357
00:20:03,870 --> 00:20:05,960
You fought well, France!

358
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,590
You did your job well!

359
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,920
Both teams played wonderfully!

360
00:20:11,010 --> 00:20:13,090
Well done, Japan!

361
00:20:13,510 --> 00:20:16,470
You played well, France, Japan!

362
00:20:16,550 --> 00:20:19,100
You are the best.

363
00:20:19,510 --> 00:20:21,600
Oh, El.

364
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:28,770
Alright, guys, now is not the time to rejoice.

365
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:30,860
We still have penalty kicks.

366
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:32,320
Tsubasa.

367
00:20:32,780 --> 00:20:34,700
This time it's 5 against 5.

368
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:37,370
We are no longer outnumbered.

369
00:20:37,450 --> 00:20:38,370
Yes!

370
00:20:43,250 --> 00:20:44,120
Wakashimazu?

371
00:20:45,710 --> 00:20:50,130
Leave it to me, I will catch it even if my hand breaks.

372
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:54,880
Alright, guys, penalty kicks.

373
00:20:55,470 --> 00:20:56,880
Let's do it like in training.

374
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:58,390
Okay.

375
00:20:58,970 --> 00:21:01,390
Now the penalty kicks begin.

376
00:21:01,890 --> 00:21:05,890
5 players from each team will take penalty kicks.

377
00:21:06,230 --> 00:21:11,070
If it's a draw, kicks continue until one wins.

378
00:21:11,480 --> 00:21:16,900
Will the goddess of victory smile on Japan or France?

379
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:18,570
Tsubasa.

380
00:21:19,780 --> 00:21:22,040
So it finally came down to penalties.

381
00:21:22,910 --> 00:21:24,540
Who will win?

382
00:21:28,540 --> 00:21:32,800
Japan's goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun stands inside the goal.

383
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,470
France shoots first.

384
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:41,430
The first penalty will be taken by captain El Sid Pierre-kun himself.

385
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:44,270
The responsibility of the first kick that will determine who goes to the final,

386
00:21:44,350 --> 00:21:48,100
cannot belong to anyone but Pierre-kun.

387
00:21:49,020 --> 00:21:50,230
Pierre

388
00:21:50,650 --> 00:21:52,440
Pierre! Pierre!

389
00:21:52,900 --> 00:21:54,940
Pierre! Pierre!

390
00:21:55,190 --> 00:21:57,360
Pierre! Pierre!

391
00:21:57,450 --> 00:21:59,660
Pierre! Pierre!

392
00:21:59,740 --> 00:22:01,950
Pierre! Pierre!

393
00:23:47,210 --> 00:23:49,970
Next Episode: Miracle Punch